      "username": "amitesh-datascience",
      "name": "Amitesh Srivastava",
      "created_at": "2026-03-22T09:11:32.526Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes I did but after that I have also created many companies and Item in the master list and sales order invoices etc for learning and testing. Now I want to delete all these and want to setup my erpnext afresh</p>",
