    {
      "id": 496195,
      "username": "nikkothari22",
      "name": "Nikhil Kothari",
      "created_at": "2026-03-22T09:26:48.287Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh, you can delete the companies you don’t need - that will delete all records. You can also use the Transaction Deletion Record if you only want to delete the transactions and not the companies themselves: <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/delete_company_transactions\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Delete Company Transactions</a></p>\n<p>Then you can proceed to delete the customer, supplier and item masters.</p>\n<p>If you have access to your Frappe Cloud account, you can also use the “Restore Site” option to start afresh on the site - this will clean the entire site and give you a fresh start.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/nikkothari22/{size}/71132_2.png",
